Interesting. You know a robot doesn't really like to work in the same
house as another robot. This time put the robot and the box
with the bird in it in the truck. When you have both robots working,
walk away until you can't hear or see the birds anymore and
wait 14 seconds this time.

We need the number
in the second hole.

This is the result of saving everything in a room. 
