Did you drop the box with 3 holes and the robot that wants a box
like that into the truck?

Did you join the boxes to make a box with 2 holes?

Did you give the box with 2 holes to the robot that has a box
like that in his thought bubble?

Did you get up, walk away, and wait 14 seconds?

Did you take out the number from the box with 2 holes?

Well I would put the box with 3 holes and the robot that was
trained to work on boxes with 3 holes into the truck. And I give the other
box to the other robot. Then I'd stand up, leave the room, walk away from
the houses, and wait 14 seconds, return, and sit down.
Then I'd take out the number in the second hole.


